&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director, Commercial Sales to lead our Commercial (Mid-Market) segment sales team, working with customers and prospects up to 1,000 employees. As a first line leader, you&#39;ll set the strategy and operating rhythm for a team of 8 US-based Account Executives and Account Managers, while staying close enough to the field to coach the deals that matter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a genuine team-building role: You will build the team, not just carry a number. Recruit, develop, and retain sellers who become better sellers and leaders. You&#39;ll also be the sales half of a close partnership with your Customer Experience counterpart, working together so wins in the sales cycle turn into long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of this team of amazing humans,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop your Account Executives and Account Managers: through 1:1 feedback, performance reviews, and by getting into deals alongside them when it matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, onboard, and develop AEs and AMs who who bring both the right skills and the right values to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the sales half of a true partnership with your CX Director counterpart in our Pod Model, aligned on strategy, accountable together for the customer&#39;s experience across the full lifecycle\Set the vision for your team and translate it into a strategy that gets you to quota, sustainably, quarter over quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the rhythm that makes the rest possible: forecasting that leadership can trust, pipeline that&#39;s actually worked, and performance tracking that surfaces problems early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine track record of building teams, not just managing headcount, but recruiting, developing, and retaining people who grow into better sellers and leaders under you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading a sales team, ideally in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real fluency with the mechanics: Salesforce, Gong, forecasting discipline, and a working command of MEDDPICC or an equivalent qualification framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct and credibility to work well across functions, especially with Customer Experience and SDR, where influence matters more than authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience growing revenue in more than one way, landing new logos and expanding current customers, because at Culture Amp, both matter to the number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You are&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
