&lt;p&gt;As the Financial Accountant covering a 12-month maternity leave, you will be a key contributor to the month-end close process, financial reporting, and balance sheet integrity for Culture Amp&#39;s global entities. You&#39;ll also lead treasury operations and champion AI-driven automation across the finance function — partnering closely with the Finance Manager and Director of Financial Reporting to ensure our financial records are accurate, compliant, and audit-ready, while helping build the agents and workflows that make our reporting processes faster and smarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of this team of amazing humans,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and own majority of the month-end close process for global entities, in compliance with relevant local standards and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed reconciliations and supporting schedules for complex balance sheet accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete weekly and monthly bank reconciliations, ensuring balances agree to bank statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive month end cash flow reporting, conducting variance analysis with insightful commentaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the fixed asset register and prepare supporting schedules for quarterly investor and bank reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead treasury management — daily bank account monitoring, processing transfers/payments, and managing corporate credit cards in Expensify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a champion for AI adoption within the finance function, designing and building AI agents/workflows (using tools such as Claude) that automate recurring financial reporting, reconciliation, and compliance tasks — a key, measurable deliverable for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the preparation and lodgement of statutory/compliance reporting, including ABS surveys, US Census Bureau surveys, and other ad-hoc compliance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams and become a power user of NetSuite, recommending and implementing process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key collaborator for external audits, ensuring timely resolution of audit queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CA/CPA qualification (or in the final stages), with several years&#39; financial accounting experience in a global/multi-entity organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical accounting knowledge (IFRS/AASB) with hands-on month-end close, reconciliation, and statutory reporting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NetSuite or a comparable ERP system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience, or strong genuine interest, in using AI tools such as Claude to build agents/automations that streamline finance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to treasury operations — bank administration, payments, and corporate card platforms such as Expensify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, an ownership mindset, and the ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced, global finance team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
