&lt;p&gt;As a senior leader within the Global Demand Generation team,you will design and champion our overarching ABM programs. You will own the strategic deployment of 1:few (industry and cohort-aligned), and 1:many (scaled, always-on) ABM programs spanning paid, owned, and earned channels. This role is responsible for the ongoing optimization and account research via the 6sense platform, and will partner closely with Global &amp;amp; Regional leadership to drive high-value New Logo acquisition and support Expansion (Customer) cross-sell motions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
