&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, develop, and lead the overarching ABM program for the global upper Commercial &amp;amp; Enterprise segments, ensuring a consistent, personalized experience across channels to accelerate pipeline and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and execute multi-tiered ABM strategies, including targeted 1:Few plays for top-tier accounts, 1:few industry-specific vertical campaigns, and programmatic 1:many campaigns for broader market capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the global super-user and strategic marketing owner of the 6sense platform; govern data-driven segment building, mature intent keyword architecture, and automated orchestration playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales and Regional Marketing Leads to establish deep feedback loops, aligning ABM programs with localized sales goals while maintaining a unified global strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish measurement frameworks and campaign metrics alongside marketing analytics teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the collaborative creation of bespoke content and high-impact messaging tailored to specific target account lists, industries, and/or executive personas across email, executive events, paid media, and conversational marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market, industry, and account-level research to uncover unmet needs, pain points, and buying triggers, translating these insights into actionable ABM playbooks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
